---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/city.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cleaning Jobs on the North Shore | Apply Once"
  description="Apply once for cleaning jobs on Auckland's North Shore. Suitable applicants complete Spruce onboarding and are considered for work from Devonport to Albany."
  path="/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/"
  ogTitle="Cleaning Jobs on the North Shore | Cleaning Jobs NZ"
  ogDescription="Apply once for Spruce-standard cleaning work across the North Shore."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Cleaning Jobs on the North Shore | Cleaning Jobs NZ",
    "description": "Apply once for Spruce-standard cleaning work across the North Shore. Suitable applicants are considered for residential, commercial, and specialist work allocation.",
    "url": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/#webpage",
    "datePublished": "2026-08-23",
    "dateModified": "2026-08-23",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#website" },
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/#breadcrumb" }
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/#breadcrumb",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Cleaning jobs in Auckland", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-auckland/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "North Shore", "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/" }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-north-shore/#faq",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Do you cover Albany and the northern suburbs?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes, applications from Albany, Browns Bay, and the northern Shore are welcome. Apply with your location and we'll know which areas you can realistically cover."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is transport important on the Shore?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes. You need your own reliable vehicle to work with Spruce on the North Shore. Public transport alone is not enough to reach the areas we cover."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Is North Shore work guaranteed if I apply?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "No. Work is not guaranteed anywhere. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification. Applying puts you in the pool for consideration when suitable work comes up."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <div class="wrap">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Auckland</a></li>
          <li aria-current="page">North Shore</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">North Shore</span>
        <h1>Cleaning jobs on the North Shore.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Looking for cleaning jobs on the North Shore? Apply once to be considered for Spruce-standard cleaning work across the Shore. We review every application individually and contact suitable applicants about a next step.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Apply now <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reliable-split">
          <div class="reliable-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Across the Shore</span>
            <h2>Cleaning work across the North Shore.</h2>
            <p class="callout">The Shore runs from the bridge to Albany.</p>
            <p>The Spruce Company delivers residential, commercial, and specialist cleaning across the North Shore, and where you can be considered depends on the areas you can reach and the work types you suit. We ask about your location and transport when you apply.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tick-panel">
            <div class="tick-list">
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Devonport, Takapuna and Milford</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Birkenhead and Northcote</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Glenfield and Beach Haven</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Albany and Browns Bay</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Torbay, Mairangi Bay and Forrest Hill</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="suburb-note">
          <p><strong>Spruce works across the North Shore suburbs above.</strong> Tell us where you are based and the areas you can realistically reach when you apply.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Work types</span>
          <h2>The cleaning work you could be allocated on the Shore</h2>
          <p>The mix depends on demand in your part of the Shore. Suitable Spruce-certified cleaners are considered for three broad areas of work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="types-groups">
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Homes</span>
            <h3>Residential cleaning</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Regular and one-off home cleans across the North Shore, plus end-of-tenancy work.</p>
            <ul><li>Residential cleaning</li><li>Deep cleaning</li><li>End of tenancy</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Business</span>
            <h3>Office &amp; commercial</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Scheduled cleans for offices, retail, and commercial sites on the Shore and across the wider region.</p>
            <ul><li>Office cleaning</li><li>Commercial cleaning</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Specialist</span>
            <h3>Trades-adjacent &amp; add-on</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Builders&rsquo; and handover cleans, carpet and upholstery support, and window cleaning support.</p>
            <ul><li>Builders &amp; handover cleans</li><li>Carpet &amp; upholstery support</li><li>Window cleaning support</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="types-note">
          Not every work type is available in every part of the Shore. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="why-split">
          <div class="why-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Why apply here</span>
            <h2>One application for cleaning work across the Shore.</h2>
            <p>Rather than chasing roles suburb by suburb, you apply once and we keep your details on file. Suitable applicants are considered for work as demand comes up.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-panel">
            <div class="why-rows">
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">01</span><div><h3>One place to apply</h3><p>Apply once for North Shore cleaning work instead of role by role.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">02</span><div><h3>Spruce standard behind it</h3><p>Onboarding and training to the same checklists and expectations used on every Spruce clean.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">03</span><div><h3>Matched to your area</h3><p>Considered for work based on where you are, demand, availability, and certification.</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band" id="apply-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Apply for cleaning work on the North Shore.</h2>
        <p>Tell us your suburb, experience, transport, and the type of cleaning work you suit. We&rsquo;ll review your application and contact you if there&rsquo;s a suitable next step.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Start application <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Work is not guaranteed. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block faq-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">North Shore questions</span>
          <h2>Applying on the Shore</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you cover Albany and the northern suburbs?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes, applications from Albany, Browns Bay, and the northern Shore are welcome. Apply with your location and we&rsquo;ll know which areas you can realistically cover.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is transport important on the Shore?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes. You need your own reliable vehicle to work with Spruce on the North Shore. Public transport alone isn&rsquo;t enough to reach the areas we cover.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is North Shore work guaranteed if I apply?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>No. Work is not guaranteed anywhere. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification. Applying puts you in the pool for consideration when suitable work comes up.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</span>
          <h2>More ways into cleaning work</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="related-links">
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-central-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Central Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-west-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in West Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-south-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in South Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/">No experience? Start here</a>
          <a href="/how-to-become-a-cleaner/">How to become a cleaner in NZ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
